Theater 3000" ♪

32
00:01:22,461 --> 00:01:25,430
[Doors thud and creak]

33
00:01:25,464 --> 00:01:27,156
[Doors whir]

34
00:01:28,122 --> 00:01:30,745
[Doors thud and clank]

35
00:01:30,780 --> 00:01:32,609
-30 seconds to commercial sign.
-Hi, everybody.

36
00:01:32,644 --> 00:01:34,163
Welcome to
the Satellite of Love.

37
00:01:34,197 --> 00:01:34,991
I'm Joel.

38
00:01:35,025 --> 00:01:36,717
I'm still trapped in outer space

39
00:01:36,751 --> 00:01:39,720
