maintain my sunny disposition.

40
00:01:39,754 --> 00:01:42,688
As you can see, I've redecorated
the Satellite of Love.

41
00:01:42,723 --> 00:01:45,243
So, if I ever do make it
off this satellite

42
00:01:45,277 --> 00:01:46,278
and get back to Earth,

43
00:01:46,313 --> 00:01:49,281
I can do a talk show panel,
you know.

44
00:01:49,316 --> 00:01:52,008
-Commercial sign in 15 seconds.

45
